# TV360 Lucky Draw — Design System

**Figma source:** [HOME screen](https://www.figma.com/design/gHuCWVdmvHEAG3fQDCWaol/Untitled?node-id=2-755&m=dev)

Stack: React + Vite + Tailwind CSS v4. Use a full-page vertical layout with a stadium background image. Do not use absolute pixel positioning from Figma — use flex/grid and responsive spacing.

**Styling rule:** Use Tailwind utility classes in components for all visual styling (colors, borders, gradients, shadows, scrollbars, responsive layout). Only declare **fonts** in `src/index.css` (`@font-face` + `.font-*` classes). Do not add other custom CSS classes to `index.css`.

## Page Structure (4 Divisions)

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 1. HEADER                               │
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ 2. TAGLINE (centered)                   │
├──────────────────┬──────────────────────┤
│ 3a. Rewards List │ 3b. Winner Panel     │
├──────────────────┴──────────────────────┤
│ 4. FOOTER                               │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Division 1 — Header
- Top-left: **TV360 Myanmar logo** then **FIFA World Cup logo** side by side
- Fixed height, horizontal padding ~90px from left edge
- No centered content in this row

### Division 2 — Tagline
- Horizontally centered
- Main title: **"LUCKY 360 CUP"** — large italic display text with white-to-grey gradient and gold/red glow
- Subtitle: campaign dates (e.g. `12 June 2026 to 20 July 2026`) in white
- Accent: **"LuckyDraw"** in gold-to-red gradient script style, right of dates

### Division 3 — Main Content (two columns)

**Left column — Rewards list**
- Dark red card (`#7a0513`) with `border-[#ff2e33]`, `rounded-xl`, drop shadow
- Card header bar (`#61030e`): **"LUCKY 360 CUP PROMOTION CAMPAIGN REWARDS"**, **Supreme Extrabold** via `.font-supreme-extrabold`
- Hint text: *"Click the item you want to draw"* in `#c7bebe`, **Supreme Regular** via `.font-supreme-regular`
- Scrollable list of reward items; each item shows: overlapping thumbnail on the left, prize name, quantity (`0/1`)
- Selected item: 2.28px radial gradient border (`#ffc400` → `#ff080e`); yellow left glow `linear-gradient(268.84deg, transparent, #F9C723)` behind thumbnail; unselected: `border border-solid border-[#b2020d]`

**Right column — Winner panel**
- Prize name bar: dark red bg (`#670105`), gold gradient text (`#ff8a04` → `#fc0`), **Supreme Bold** via `.font-supreme-bold`
- Prize image: centered, prominent product visual on glowing pedestal
- Label: **"WINNER'S PHONE NUMBER"** — small caps, **Povlar** via `.font-povlar`, white-to-grey gradient (`#FFFFFF` → `#BDBDBD`)
- Phone display: large bold placeholder (`09xxxxxxxxx`) in dark gradient text inside a styled input/display box
- **SELECT WINNER** button: glossy red pill with gold trim, white gradient text
- **Upload File** button: grey pill (`#6e6e6e`), white underlined text, upload icon — accepts Excel

### Division 4 — Footer
- Full-width red bar at bottom
- Left: **WORLD CUP PACKAGES** + package icons
- Center: *"Catch Every Match LIVE from Start to Finish on TV360"*
- Right: QR code + website link (`tv360.mytel.com.mm/app`)

