**Fonts:** Declare all custom fonts once in `src/index.css` via `@font-face` and `.font-*` utility classes — do not import font files in components.

| Class | Font | Use for |
|-------|------|---------|
| `.font-display` | Georgia (fallback) | Legacy display text until migrated to Povlar |
| `.font-povlar` | Povlar (`povlar.otf`) | Winner panel phone number label |
| `.font-ui` | Segoe UI stack | General UI labels, lists, footer |
| `.font-supreme-regular` | Supreme Regular (`Supreme-Regular.ttf`) | Rewards list hint text |
| `.font-supreme-bold` | Supreme Bold (`Supreme-Bold.otf`) | Winner panel prize name bar |
| `.font-supreme-extrabold` | Supreme Extrabold (`Supreme-Extrabold.otf`) | Rewards list card header |

Available assets: `src/assets/fonts/povlar.otf`, `Supreme-Regular.ttf`, `Supreme-Bold.otf`, `Supreme-Extrabold.otf`. Add other weights here when provided.

**Tailwind patterns** (use inline in components, not global CSS):

```jsx
// Gold gradient text
className="bg-gradient-to-b from-[#ff8a04] to-[#fc0] bg-clip-text text-transparent"

// Label gradient text (180deg white → grey)
className="bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,#FFFFFF_0%,#BDBDBD_100%)] bg-clip-text text-transparent"

// Text stroke accent
className="[-webkit-text-stroke:1px_#ff080e] [paint-order:stroke_fill]"

// Selected reward item — overlapping image + gradient border + left glow
<button className="relative ...">
  <img className="absolute left-0 z-20 ..." /> {/* overlaps card */}
  <div className="ml-[28px] rounded-lg p-[2.28px] bg-[radial-gradient(...)]">
    <div className="relative rounded-lg bg-white pl-[34px] ...">
      <div className="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-[46px] bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#F9C723_0%,rgba(249,199,35,0.45)_55%,rgba(249,199,35,0)_100%)]" />
      ...
    </div>
  </div>
</button>

// Responsive page padding (< 1200px)
className="px-[90px] max-[1200px]:px-8"
```

## Component Guidelines

- Extract sections as components: `Header`, `Tagline`, `RewardsList`, `WinnerPanel`, `Footer`
- Reward selection is interactive — clicking a list item updates the right panel (prize name + image)
- Use semantic HTML (`header`, `main`, `footer`, `button`) and accessible labels on all buttons
- Style with Tailwind classes directly on elements — avoid adding non-font rules to `index.css`
- Background image covers full viewport; content sits above it with appropriate z-index

```jsx
// ✅ GOOD — semantic 4-division layout
<div className="min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-cover bg-center">
  <header className="flex items-center gap-4 px-[90px] py-6">...</header>
  <section className="text-center">...</section>
  <main className="flex flex-1 gap-8 px-[90px]">
    <RewardsList />
    <WinnerPanel />
  </main>
  <footer className="bg-[#7a0513] flex items-center justify-between px-[90px] py-4">...</footer>
</div>

// ❌ BAD — flat single div, no division structure
<div><img /><h1 /><ul /><button /></div>
```
